[*] Method: Straight-Through Estimator + CORE/BINARY/PRUNE Logic Guidance
[*]   forward:  CORE = w_float * core_gain * K     (精确计算)
[*]             BINARY = sign(w) * alpha * K       (二值符号)
[*]             PRUNE = 0                           (静默剪枝)
[*]   backward: STE through w_float (CORE+BINARY), PRUNE 无梯度
[*]   update:   Adam on w_float
[*] Logic Guidance (每步,全层):
[*]             CORE  → maximize |act(a) - act(b)|  (差异化反义词)
[*]             BINARY → minimize (act(a) - act(b))^2 (收敛共性)
[*]             PRUNE → skip (保持静默)
[*] Whitebox probe: every 10 steps observe CORE/BINARY/PRUNE circuit

